WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
Today we are going to play a match with Russian Matryoshka dolls

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.020
After each point you win

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.480
You place the doll on the table

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.520
And if you hit the doll

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.340
you lose the point and go one step back

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.020
First one to get to the smallest one wins

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.540
Ok, let's make the draw

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.680
I'll take this side

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.280
You get the red Matryoshka

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.160
But I'm confident with this little one!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.240
How can you lose with that?

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.360
Team bandana!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:28.380
Come on!

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.960
I'm placing it on the backhand side

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.180
No! She has lost the bandana!

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.840
There is no way we are going to win this point!

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.780
It's okay

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.680
Still defending the backhand side

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.020
Almost hit the blue one

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:18.860
Come on Babushka!

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:19.780
We can do this!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.980
That's some impressive playing, guys!

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:42.080
Otto is just playing better when the Babushkas get smaller!

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:42.940
That's true!

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.220
Next is this

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.320
What!?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.840
No! Emil why are you laughing?

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.020
I had it under control!

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.280
Time to open up

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.660
Mama Matryoshka

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.780
In the middle

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:18.660
And we'll put the bandana... it's her secret weapon!

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.260
She got it on!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.240
I have to go one step back now

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.720
I get to progress

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.240
We should have like mini bandanas that I put on...

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.980
Yes! Good footwork

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:37.020
Back you go

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.140
Ok, you are back!

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.780
A bit smaller than the first one!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.160
Oh you got through my defense

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.180
Second defense over here

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.700
Newest member of the team

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.780
I think it was the wind!

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:12.160
Ok, let's check what the VAR (video assistant referee) says!

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.820
That's a clear hit!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.040
One step back

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.000
You might be seeing a pattern here

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.040
There is 5 more in here

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.520
Yea, imagine: 5 more!

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.360
And we are supposed to play with them!

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.520
You may be taller but... I'm faster!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.100
How did that go on?

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.300
My newest recruit

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.140
This is the Matryoshak

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.080
And this is the ball

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.760
They are all looking at me

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.460
They are still quite scary looking like!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.300
Where did it go?

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:27.040
Maybe it's just distracting me more if I put it there but...

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.220
Let's go with that

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.920
He is knocking down his own team!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.760
I said it's going to distract me!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.520
You were right

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.560
It's like a half of a ping pong ball

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.640
Nice one

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.280
There we have it!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.100
I'm sorry

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.340
Just for fun, I leave this here

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.740
And this point, this makes no sense

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.280
Around the net!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.420
I had to go for it!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.780
Always have to go for around the nets

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:17.360
In any situation, you always have to go for it!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.700
You mean there is still 1 more?

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.800
Yea, there is 1 more!

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.180
I wonder what's the right technique with this?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.840
Not a single shot was hit with the doll

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Wow this is so small

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.080
You can go there

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:45.780
Final generation!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.640
Good shot baby Matryoshka!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.800
Well done!

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:57.880
And guys

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:01.320
We heard that there is still a lot of you who haven't subscribed

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.700
Don't do that!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.340
Remember to subscribe

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.500
Oh I lost a part of me!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.120
So help Pongfinity

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.760
And subscribe to their channel

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.840
Until next time!

